[OUTPUT] ## general overview of the project Develop a web application named 'Travel Memories Sharer' that allows users to share their travel memories with friends and family by creating interactive and visually appealing travel albums. ## software functional requirements 1. **User Registration**    - The system shall provide a Registration Page where users can create an account by entering a username and password. 2. **User Login**    - The system shall provide a Login Page where users can log in to their account by entering their username and password. 3. **Album Creation and Upload**    - The system shall allow users to create and upload travel albums. 4. **Album Customization**    - The system shall provide users with options to customize the layout and design of their travel albums. 5. **Album Sharing**    - The system shall allow users to share their albums with friends and family, with options for public or private sharing. 6. **Album Exploration**    - The system shall enable users to explore and view albums shared by other users. 7. **User Interaction**    - The system shall allow users to interact with other users by liking, commenting, or sharing their albums. 8. **User Following**    - The system shall allow users to follow other users and receive updates on their new albums or content. 9. **User Logout**    - The system shall provide a logout functionality that returns users to the Login Page. [/OUTPUT]

